rst try, including the divide/remainder instruction checks, register, liveness and uniqueness.\n- **Cosim:** passed on selftest (4 divides) and CoreMark (5), under random memory stalls.\n- **Timing:** the worst path is now forwarding → ALU → data-memory address, at 23 logic levels.\n\nTwo of the gate commands needed extra settings to run locally: formal needs `RTL_DIR=cores/bench/rtl CORE_NAME=bench`, and cosim needs `NRET=1` (without it the build fails). Details are in `cores/bench/implementation_notes.md`.", "ttft_ms": 1972, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 510833, "uuid": "bc279c3c-6f87-46e5-b77e-404569ea000b", "ttft_stream_ms": 1000, "time_to_request_ms": 34, "first_content_frame_ms": 1000, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}

