e M-op result forwards from EX/MEM/MEM-WB exactly\n       like any ALU result; no forwarding-unit change needed.\n\n  4. Tests: add test/test_mdu.py (clocked cocotb) carrying every M-ext vector", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
